## Story Description
Add Contentstack Live Preview support so editors see draft content update in real time and linked/tabular references show draft values. RETEST: a prior attempt at this exact fix was rejected by team-lead review with specific, concrete defects — see 'Prior review feedback' below. Do not repeat them.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Contentstack Stack options include a live_preview block with enable:true and preview_token set from CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN (NOT management_token — the delivery SDK's live_preview config reads preview_token; management_token is the wrong key and silently breaks preview).
- Do NOT add a `host` field inside the live_preview block. Host is handled separately via Stack.setHost(CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST), which already exists and is correct — adding host inside live_preview with a possibly-empty value can break requests.
- ICommonContentstackConfig (src/interface/contentstack.ts) gains an optional live_preview field so preview context (live_preview/preview_hash) can flow through to Contentstack queries in setCommonConfig — this file IS in scope for this story; do not escalate it to a separate ticket.
- New vitest unit tests exist at test/unit/services/contentstack.test.ts covering: (1) live_preview block present with preview_token when CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN is set, (2) live_preview absent when the token is unset, (3) setHost called with CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST when set, taking priority over CONTENTSTACK_API_HOST.
